<title>USA: Dillard changes name to Dillard's Inc.</title>
<headline>Dillard changes name to Dillard's Inc.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE ROCK, Ark. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillard Department Stores Inc on Monday said its stockholders approved a proposal to change the name of the company to Dillard's Inc.</p>
<p>The name change is effective immediately, the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
